{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["Scripture mentions the names of the fathers until it reaches the distinguished one, namely King Hezekiah. Now according to reasoning, Amariah was the brother of Manasseh. Do not wonder on account of Josiah being third from Hezekiah, for more than a hundred years pass from the day Hezekiah grew up to father children until King Josiah."], :book :zephaniah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zephaniah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zfanya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:12.020378489Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}